  "texts": [
    {
      "spokenText": "Comme dessert, on sert des figues à l'arequipe, et le dressage est très élégant.",
      "textSHA256": "40f5cd68cc8ac51e484c129105142c654ef0051b42de02b4f17ecf5cf97bc291",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "master-travel-dinner:9:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 7
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Daniel : J'aimerais que l'ajiaco ait un tout petit peu moins de sel.",
      "textSHA256": "b7c93f2e7459e073973d18d4d110a21cc19b43238ad5b179667b34f967fd6173",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "master-travel-dinner:9:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 14
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Daniel : J'aimerais que l'attente soit plus courte quand vous ouvrirez au public.",
      "textSHA256": "ab866571140d8f12a60e4563bee26d6c89fefea0da70ae25e5df9ff8ce111fd9",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "master-travel-dinner:9:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 13
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Daniel : Je suggère que la cuisine vérifie le niveau de sel.",
      "textSHA256": "203bfe4a97fb50728c67584c32880b12801ad4b09b6dfa6aae9e3e5eb921fa07",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "master-travel-dinner:9:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 16
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Daniel : Je vous conseille de servir la crème à part.",
      "textSHA256": "ea225025c8b42c81f7d09a63b03cf0ad421dfb4de99f901ca9c8a3e0a73c5415",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "master-travel-dinner:9:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 17
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Daniel : Je vous recommande de goûter l'ajiaco avant de le servir.",
      "textSHA256": "f5d10e1463042b9435a684b80a8713266245bd70ea53c78e021598a105695514",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "master-travel-dinner:9:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 15
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Daniel : Pour moi, le plat principal a mis trop de temps à arriver.",
      "textSHA256": "bf5cc3e03e9923fa33d6eeed350c72dea8615da9ec33be72f6d76899bc01b6ad",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "master-travel-dinner:9:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 12
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Daniel : Sans aucun doute, le dessert est votre point fort.",
      "textSHA256": "0d934c6149864963abca40316f95d1bec7b17be05a7b92c64b3db01a37bbe206",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "master-travel-dinner:9:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 11
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Daniel : Valentina, les figues à l'arequipe étaient spectaculaires.",
      "textSHA256": "76b2af1956fa48f3092106a276900a8dc298139bb78f734af88b05598c6ecd4b",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "master-travel-dinner:9:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 10
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Daniel : Voulez-vous que je vous dise d'abord ce que j'ai le plus aimé ?",
      "textSHA256": "01e69702cfc849cf9a39991225aa73cc815f97c4cfc85abec6fcd218a4f4e33d",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "master-travel-dinner:9:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 9
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Daniel, pourriez-vous me donner votre avis franc ?",
      "textSHA256": "6ec65fa29aeb47f71f982d7dbad2a331a62ce6ca5bc34338b4b7c73c4ec15dd3",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "master-travel-dinner:9:fr-en",
          "surface": "speaking-opening"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Ensuite, Valentina s'approche de la table et demande à Daniel une critique constructive.",
      "textSHA256": "6788696ff54b8250def36f88ba5f5b58b2e598b64d4980f5b2a81e44a75289fe",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "master-travel-dinner:9:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 8
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "J'aimerais que l'ajiaco ait un tout petit peu moins de sel.",
      "textSHA256": "56f876f51ac9fc266f05cc8f3c7a4b2e33d2521dee83e922f9044e75a535b1d9",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "master-travel-dinner:9:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 18
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Je le dis gentiment : le dessert a été le meilleur moment de la soirée.",
      "textSHA256": "27b38ced4977bfa8547fa64638322a5ad625d02076e7bdbb56eccfea310b1902",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "master-travel-dinner:9:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 22
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Je suggère que la cuisine vérifie le niveau de sel.",
      "textSHA256": "eee99bba0cea4dad10a124fbe0f434223a255dec320e0cc2b386f9d175bf604a",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "master-travel-dinner:9:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 19
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Je vous conseille de servir la crème à part.",
      "textSHA256": "acbaeb30534d9dbcd36ddb829618ee742c75ae86aeb42bac0d2377a0bdc8202f",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "master-travel-dinner:9:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 21
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Je vous recommande de goûter l'ajiaco avant de le servir.",
      "textSHA256": "b5065585a6082ca6695b96f7d9e166ea1413e854f0c14c9f411b258d8b7eef14",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "master-travel-dinner:9:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 17
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "L'ajiaco a mis 50 minutes à arriver et, en plus, il était assez salé.",
      "textSHA256": "4f025dac581de3d648b02d55fd4b5088ce31d870177e6735af0bf66c92a153d4",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "master-travel-dinner:9:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 6
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "La cheffe Valentina, 26 ans, veut écouter ses premiers clients avant d'ouvrir au public.",
      "textSHA256": "d02550ad472e3e30eab3dbf8097c75f9ec17c55ea3431ad100bd68f85242faf2",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "master-travel-dinner:9:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 2
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "La papa criolla épaissit le bouillon, et chaque assiette est accompagnée d'un demi-épi de maïs.",
      "textSHA256": "5658c788640479f98153bdd6a272be1feb72d034bb68b8365b9a45e1968c4b6b",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "master-travel-dinner:9:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 4
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Les câpres sont servies à part, mais la crème est déjà mélangée à la soupe.",
      "textSHA256": "dafb4a0fb6c71b37a4a0c2fd294e77fd70220bdfab19980dd28c1c252d75b4ee",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "master-travel-dinner:9:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 5
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Merci pour votre franchise, Daniel. Je note chaque suggestion.",
      "textSHA256": "84cc790dcd4b44d46adb49712878b0e251c324a8377b461adfe5a9a640810ec0",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "master-travel-dinner:9:fr-en",
          "surface": "speaking-closure"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Pour moi, le plat principal a mis trop de temps à arriver.",
      "textSHA256": "c808e05564bf197b8269ec07fede148c7f050f708c86d75efd3eee97d893ada1",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "master-travel-dinner:9:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 20
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Samedi, Daniel dîne lors de la soirée d'essai de La Casona, un petit restaurant de Bogotá.",
      "textSHA256": "11bfbb09dd81f92cde2690bb3637bb323198352aa00be91dd874bb151e5dbbed",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "master-travel-dinner:9:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Son ajiaco contient des guascas fraîches du marché de Paloquemao, qui lui donnent un assaisonnement typiquement bogotanais.",
      "textSHA256": "f63dd6d8e9b11b49bcab708d2ae79eee4e1cd827ee6c62d38413de2b25b159cb",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "master-travel-dinner:9:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 3
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Valentina note chaque suggestion et remercie Daniel pour sa franchise.",
      "textSHA256": "461de17c63ffe46aad19fa2c228ff3defc7c4a2e0d1a5bac63b6a98a4abd7b89",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "master-travel-dinner:9:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 18
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Valentina, les figues à l'arequipe étaient spectaculaires.",
      "textSHA256": "739801cb29c0750f65b57aa2b76b2c69db23fc0014c52056e0a8df9c71dfefb5",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "master-travel-dinner:9:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 16
        }
      ]
    },
